what did it live on in those far distant times?

00:37:29.400 --> 00:37:52.000
We if I follow it, I'll find out what it ate.

00:37:52.000 --> 00:37:59.000
Science calls this snake, Chicanthophis, and it was truly immense. Certainly big enough

